1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,568
Everybody’s chasing money.

2
00:00:02,768 --> 00:00:04,168
The next hustle.

3
00:00:04,168 --> 00:00:05,661
The next app.

4
00:00:05,661 --> 00:00:09,401
The next thing that’s supposed to make you rich.

5
00:00:09,701 --> 00:00:10,918
And I get it.

6
00:00:10,918 --> 00:00:14,285
Bills don’t care about your passion.

7
00:00:14,535 --> 00:00:16,540
But here’s where we mess up.

8
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:23,048
You can build ten apps. Launch five businesses. Automate your whole life…

9
00:00:23,448 --> 00:00:25,339
…and still be broke.

10
00:00:26,039 --> 00:00:28,201
Because activity ain’t income.

11
00:00:28,251 --> 00:00:30,221
And attention ain’t a business model.

12
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:35,002
We get so focused on how to get the money…

13
00:00:35,002 --> 00:00:38,766
we stop asking why anybody would give it to us.

14
00:00:38,816 --> 00:00:40,181
Think about that.

15
00:00:40,781 --> 00:00:44,796
Money moves when somebody sees enough value to trade something for it.

16
00:00:45,346 --> 00:00:51,482
So instead of asking AI, “How do I make ten thousand dollars?”

17
00:00:51,682 --> 00:00:56,327
Ask it, “What problem can I solve that’s worth ten thousand dollars?”

18
00:00:56,677 --> 00:00:58,680
Then ask who has that problem.

19
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:00,583
How they’re solving it right now.

20
00:01:00,583 --> 00:01:03,490
And why they’d pay you to fix it.

21
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:08,388
Stop chasing the money long enough to understand what makes it move.

22
00:01:09,038 --> 00:01:11,967
Quiet Bands. Build what matters.

